RESERVED_KEYWORDS=DOMAIN|VERSION|STATUS|GOAL|FOUNDATION_MODEL|ARCHITECTURE|RULES|FORBIDDEN|STYLE|STRATEGY|RISK_MODEL|OBSERVABILITY|METRICS|VALIDATION|OUTPUT|INSTRUCTION|LAYERS|GRAMMAR|PRIMITIVES|SEMANTIC_CONSTRUCTS|SEPARATORS|QUALITY_GATE|RELEASE_STATE

